  "problem": "If $p(x)=-5{x}^{2}$ and $q(x)=9{x}^{6},$ then\n\n${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\frac{{x}^{4}\\cdot p(x)}{q(x)}=$\n{{field-1}}.",
